OL,3,ANumber of people claiming key
OL,4,Adisability benefit hits record high
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of people claiming Personal
OL,7,FIndependence Payments (Pip) in England
OL,8,Fand Wales has hit a record high,
OL,9,Faccording to new government figures.
OL,11,FAs of July, just over four million
OL,12,Fpeople were entitled to claim the
OL,13,Fbenefit, compared to 3.83 million the
OL,14,Fprevious year, an increase of 7%, data
OL,15,Ffrom the Department for Work and
OL,16,FPensions (DWP) showed.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
