OL,3,ANumber of people claiming key
OL,4,Adisability benefit hits record high
OL,5,
OL,6,FPip is designed to support people with
OL,7,Fthe extra costs of being disabled or
OL,8,Fliving with long-term physical or
OL,9,Fmental health conditions, and
OL,10,Feligibility is not affected by a
OL,11,Fperson's income or savings.
OL,13,FIn July, Sir Stephen Timms, who is
OL,14,Fleading a review on Pip, said in his
OL,15,Finterim report that the system was "not
OL,16,Ffit for purpose".
